urements, and calculated values; this web spec verifies screens and values returned by the API.\",\n  \"Execution of procurement-source synchronization, source-ID deduplication and updates, failed-record processing, PO-line cost allocation, and persistence of PO-to-lot-to-pen relationships; the web requirements verify synchronization outcomes and mappings displayed to users.\",\n  \"Inventory movement accounting, wastage application to actual consumption, stock sufficiency enforcement, and atomic rollback of rejected activities; the web requirements verify returned inventory results and errors.\",\n  \"Calculation correctness for forecasts, ration optimization, inventory projections, feeding costs, lot rollups, weight metrics, FCR, profitability, and recommendations; the web requirements verify values and recommendations displayed from API responses.\",\n  \"Enforcing account authentication, role authorization, and server-side permission checks; the web requirements verify sign-in and role-specific screens.\",\n  \"Supplying or seeding demo records and producing report data; the web requirements verify supplied sample data and exported report files.\",\n  \"Live procurement or receiving connectivity, file-upload ingestion, self-service registration, SSO, and offline operation.\"\n ],\n \"requirements\": [\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An administrator-managed account exists and the sign-in page is open\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-1.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen shows email and password fields, no self-service registration or SSO controls, and the signed-in user's role and available pages\",\n     \"when\": \"The user inspects the sign-in controls and submits the account credentials\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An Administrator is signed in\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-1.2\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen shows account controls with email, password, and Administrator and Operator role values, plus 