nd receiving records from the configured mock source and display returned records, source identifiers, per-record synchronization outcomes, and errors.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-2\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"ASM-1\",\n    \"ASM-20\",\n    \"ASM-21\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API provides a PO line mapped to multiple lots and pens, with available procurement and animal fields\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-3.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen shows the PO line, source identifiers, related lots and pens, available vendor, cost, head-count, weight, breed, age, and source fields, and each pen's capacity and current animal count\",\n     \"when\": \"A user opens the imported record details or procurement traceability view\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A PO line has a total cost of 1000 USD and two lots assigned 60 and 40 received animals\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-3.2\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen shows purchase-cost allocation values of 600 USD and 400 USD for the respective lots\",\n     \"when\": \"A user opens the PO line's lot allocations\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The source response omits an animal's sex\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-3.3\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen shows the sex field as Unknown\",\n     \"when\": \"A user opens that animal's imported details\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The Feedlot web app shall display PO-line-to-lot-to-pen traceability, available procurement and animal fields, pen capacity and current animal counts, and lot purchase-cost allocations proportional to assigned received head counts.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-3\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\",\n    \"Q-4\",\n    \"ASM-12\",\n    \"ASM-21\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API provides a lot target weight, receiving date, and measured 